{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>麻省理工學院物理學家及合作機構的最新模擬顯示，宇宙誕生初期形成的原初黑洞如果被類太陽恆星捕獲，可能潛入恆星內部，逐漸吞噬恆星物質，最終引發一場極為壯觀的爆炸。</strong>這類事件有望釋放出目前望遠鏡能夠探測到的輻射爆發，為尋找大爆炸後不久形成的黑洞提供新途徑，也可能幫助科學家研究佔據宇宙大部分物質的神秘暗物質。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588258.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T17:44:20.596134+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T17:35:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T17:37:33.498128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T17:37:33.498128+00:00","content_hash":"8dfd5d89868d5404702fa9eab52ca555a8625670a573e26845a45f71b3a8f023","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}